{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mVslkPcq6F1795601987.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>理想汽車第三季虧損收窄。</p><p></p><p>蝕3億元人民幣，虧損少過去年同期的6.2億元人民幣，以及第二季17億元人民幣。期內，經調整淨虧損1.1億元人民幣，去年同期蝕3.6億元人民幣。收入按年升半成，至288億元人民幣。  </p><p></p><p>集團預測第四季收入介乎317億至331億元人民幣，按年增長至少一成。汽車交付至少11萬輛，按年升幅不足百分之1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:03:59.546267+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T10:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T11:57:13.038534+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:57:18.300640+00:00","content_hash":"d4304dbdfc9441299e196485a546a9954ce7734404a566f803322fff68d25e12","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:03:59.546267+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}